-- Modifier cards, the commuting pair (n2): two Damage Plus in one barrier. Twin of n2-modifiers.bqn (merge section).
-- Batched effects observe the pre-state and commit through the registered merge law (§10): additive increments to one column commute, so the barrier takes both — 3+10+10 = 23, order-free.
-- += beside *= on one column admits no merge law and the compiler rejects the batch at emit time ("no merge law: 'Damage' written twice in one barrier"); those two cards can only ever sit in separate wand slots, which is the -a/-b order witness.
--! registry n2-modifiers
--! expect damage = 0 23 23 23 8
--! expect speed = 0 6 6 6 2

SparkBolt , Damage += 10 ; Damage += 10
